        "original_id": "07db9712-2a3d-579d-ad98-29246c4c9115",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Steve Crompton, Ken St. Andre\n- Products: Grimtooth Traps, Catalyst role-playing game supplements, Tunnels & Trolls, Nuclear War\n- Companies: Flying Buffalo\n- Topics: role-playing games, comic genres\n\nFacts:\n- Tunnels & Trolls is a fantasy role-playing game designed by Ken St. Andre and first published in 1975 by Flying Buffalo.\n- Steven S. Crompton is a Canadian-born artist, author, and designer who has worked in role-playing and comic genres since 1981.\n- In the gaming industry, Steve Crompton is best known as the artist for the Grimtooth Traps books, other Catalyst role-playing game supplements, Tunnels & Trolls, and the Nuclear War card game.",
